  Slug: reveler-in-lost-glee
  DisplayName: Reveler in Lost Glee
  IconPath: icons/creatures/magical/spirit-fire-yellow.webp
  Description: 'Revelers in lost glee are twisted apparitions that arise in desolate
    and abandoned places where people once found great joy. They take immense mirth
    in causing harm or discomfort to others and do not enjoy being attuned to animists
    who fail to laugh at their antics. Apparition Skills Circus Lore, Fortune-Telling
    Lore Apparition Spells Cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Prestidigitation]
    1st @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dizzying Colors] 2nd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Laughing
    Fit] 3rd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hypnotize] 4th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Confusion]
    5th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Scene] 6th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vibrant
    Pattern] 7th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Warp Mind] 8th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary]
    9th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wails of the Damned] Vessel Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Trickster''s
    Mirrors] Avatar Ringmaster of the Dark Celebration Speed 50 feet, ignore difficult
    terrain and greater difficult terrain Melee 1 ringmaster''s whip (reach 15 feet,
    trip), Damage @Damage[(6d10+6)[slashing]] Ranged 1 feast of the lost (acid, range
    120 feet, versatile void), Damage @Damage[(6d6+6)[acid]]'
